    "title": "July 30 Vendor Information Forum",
    "excerpt": "<p>The Office of Data and Innovation held a Vendor Information Forum on July 30, 2026. The forum was for the Making Housing Permitting Legible Across California&#8217;s Jurisdictions challenge. You can download the slides from the Forum. We also share some questions and answers from the vendor Q&amp;A. About the showcase Why is this an open &#8230; <a title=\"July 30 Vendor Information Forum\" class=\"read-more\" href=\"https://live-digital-ca-gov.pantheonsite.io/our-work/innovation-showcase/july-30-vendor-information-forum/\" aria-label=\"More on July 30 Vendor Information Forum\">Read more</a></p>\n",
